WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.550
Newton's second law: net force equals mass times acceleration.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:09.851
Eight newtons on two kilograms gives four metres per second squared.

3
00:00:16.088 --> 00:00:19.288
Same force, but double the mass: four kilograms.

4
00:00:28.655 --> 00:00:32.505
Double the mass, half the acceleration: F equals m a.
